 container.innerHTML='<section class="atlas-tutorial"><p class="tutorial-intro">A small practice courtyard, a real route, and a tiny experiment. There is no timer; pause whenever you like. Your travelling fellowship and its saved progress will wait safely outside.</p><nav aria-label="Practice steps"><ol class="tutorial-steps"></ol></nav><div class="tutorial-layout"><div><canvas class="tutorial-map" width="720" height="420" tabindex="0" aria-label="Practice courtyard. Walk to directory at 4, 8, then office entrance at 10, 4. Click ground, use movement keys, or choose the labeled route buttons. Space pauses practice."></canvas><div class="tutorial-map-notes"></div><div class="tutorial-map-tools"></div><p class="tutorial-hint tutorial-key-guide"></p></div><section class="tutorial-panel" aria-label="Current practice exercise"></section></div><p class="tutorial-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="tutorial-bottom"></div></section>';
